{"id":39450,"date":"2025-01-03T00:26:20","date_gmt":"2025-01-02T23:26:20","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=39450"},"modified":"2026-08-24T06:51:36","modified_gmt":"2026-08-24T05:51:36","slug":"limestone-ultra-trail-2025","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/limestone-ultra-trail-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Limestone Ultra Trail 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O&nbsp;<strong>Limestone Ultra Trail (LUT)&nbsp;<\/strong>\u00e9 organizado pela&nbsp;<strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Porto de M\u00f3s a Correr<\/strong>, promovido pelo&nbsp;<strong>Munic\u00edpio de Porto de M\u00f3s<\/strong>&nbsp;e em parceria com as&nbsp;<strong>Grutas de Mira de Aire<\/strong>, realizando-se no dia&nbsp;<strong>26 de Julho de 2025&nbsp;<\/strong>na localidade de Mira de Aire (complexo das Grutas de Mira de Aire).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Este evento \u00e9 composto por 3 provas competitivas.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A prova Trilhos das Grutas \u00e9 simultaneamente prova do&nbsp;Trof\u00e9u Trail Concelho Porto de M\u00f3s.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\" >\n<li>TC \u2013 Trilhos do C\u00e1rsico \u2013 34 K Circuito de Trail ADAL \u2013 Derovo &#8211; Fullprotein<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>TG \u2013 Trilhos das Grutas \u2013 20 K Circuito de Trail ADAL \u2013 Derovo &#8211; Fullprotein<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>TP \u2013 Trilho do Polje \u2013 14 k<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Caminhada D\u00b4Aire \u2013 8k<strong>Trilhos do C\u00e1rsico 34k e Trilhos das Grutas 20k &#8211; Circuito de Trail ADAL \u2013 Derovo &#8211; Fullprotein<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":42996,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[38,727],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_li